      "title": "StarCraft returns in 2030 as an open-world shooter",
      "link": "https://www.theverge.com/games/994371/starcraft-returns-in-2030-as-an-open-world-shooter",
      "description": "Blizzard originally tried to bring the StarCraft universe to the world of 3D shooters way back in 2002 with StarCraft: Ghost. It sat in development hell for years until Blizzard president Mike Morhaime confirmed that it had been canceled in 2014. Now Blizzard is giving it another go with the simply titled StarCraft. Dan Hay, [&#8230;]",
